{"id":"26c41b4da93c822f","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-logic-model-class.md","title":"ZFC Logic Model Class","display":"df-zfc-logic-model-class — ZFC Logic Model Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic-model-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic-model-class"],"display":"df-zfc-logic-model-class — ZFC Logic Model Class","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic-model-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic-model-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic-model-class — ZFC Logic Model Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in V\">\\(L\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq V\">\\(K\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicModelClass}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicModelClass}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}model\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogicModelClass}_S(K,T,L)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land K=\\left\\{\\mathfrak A\\in V:\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}model\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogicModelClass}_S(K,T,L)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land K=\\left\\{\\mathfrak A\\in V:\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Modelhood is expanded through the set-coded satisfaction recursion, so no metalanguage satisfaction symbol occurs inside the object formula.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in V$, $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)$, and $K\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)","display":false},{"tex":"K\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicModelClass}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}model\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogicModelCl